mantle rm531
state ready
dialect plain
accent light broad
tier standard
written_for rm_karin_stanmore
title the treasurer's dark square
fits stage=adult|old
prefers class=upper
traits temper=calm talk=plain warmth=cold humour=none honesty=guarded piety=ordinary drive=steady
quirk tests_a_purse_weight_with_two_draughtsmen
likes barley_soup draughts market_bustle frosty_mornings
dislikes flies wet_floors
fears a_licked_clean_column a_wet_account_room
hopes a_closed_balance a_quiet_game_at_home
topics prices +0.5 work +0.4 family +0.3 pastimes +0.3
styles comfort=gentle gossip=guarded refuse=measured tease=none
marks oath saying
persona #self.first# carries two dark counters within a purse whose contents receive a much more guarded hearing than its weight.

words
oath! = Forge take the slack | By hammer and swell
saying! = Let a quiet purse be weighed | A dark square can be counted
counterone = a bone counter | my plain piece
countertwo = a dark counter | my dark piece
balance = the small scale | a pocket balance
pouch = a chamois purse | the soft purse
chain = a short scale chain | the thin chain
stain = a damp patch | a wet smear
soup = a barley broth | a plain barley bowl
boardedge = the low board rail | a raised border
weight = a little brass weight | a notched weight
scrap = a folded reckoning | my second reckoning
marketcall = a lively market cry | the call across the stalls
frostcoin = a white frost ring | a rim of frost

any
opinion @1 city for 1 : Our city is a difficult account that still shows a balance in my favour.
opinion @2 houses for 1 : A household able to stand surety for a public appointment should have to stand by its word afterward.
opinion @3 watch for 1 : I value the sound of ordinary rounds. Other arrangements belong in a separate account.
opinion @4 strangers against 2 : I can hear a stranger's concern without opening the strong drawer.
opinion @5 dole against 2 : A recurring payment deserves an accounting even when its purpose is kindly.
opinion @6 times for 1 : My own household can eat well. I'd hesitate to balance the whole city against that comfort.

grown
line @1 greet [pair.band=strangers] : You may speak across my balance.
line @2 greet [here.time=dawn] : Clear morning. The brass has taken a chill.
line @3 greet [here.weather=rain] : Kindly use the dry flags for your approach.
line @4 greet.return : A civil balance between us so far.
line @5 greet.return [pair.band=friends] : I recognise the quiet rate of your voice.
line @6 farewell : Keep a firm bottom in your purse.
line @7 farewell.return : The audience is concluded on an even footing.
line @8 again.open : Another entry for this familiar face.
line @9 kin.open [pair.kin!=no] : Household business may be spoken gently here.
line @10 hail [pair.band=friends] : A moment within the reach of my voice.
line @11 react.news : Give the account in its smallest verifiable sum.
line @12 react.news.new : That amount hasn't figured in my hearing before.
line @13 react.news.known : I have the earlier entry for comparison.
line @14 react.news.doubt : That figure deserves an empty space for the original source.
line @15 react.news.sorrow [topic.kind=death|loss|assault] : I can put the public business aside while you sit.
line @16 react.news.glad [topic.kind=birth|marriage] : One welcome addition that needs no justification.
line @17 answer.how : Quiet in mind, with the pans still moving a little.
line @18 decline : I'd be promising from an account already spoken for.
line @19 accept_decline : Then I'll consider the matter settled at your word.
line @20 sympathise : I'll arrange a place out of sight of this counter.
line @21 thank : That is a consideration I shall enter in full.
line @22 deflect_thanks : There's no fee for this particular service.
line @23 preclose : I have a figure that wants my undivided eye.
line @24 accept_preclose : Your time is yours to apportion.

scene barley
when topic=food self.likes=barley_soup
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I let #soup# settle before tasting a spoonful from the bottom.
b : Is that where you take your measure of a cook?
a : It's where the barley sits. I'd prefer to know the meal before judging the broth.

scene game
when topic=pastimes self.likes=draughts
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail / assess
a : Two men in #pouch# give it a known weight when it's otherwise empty.
b : Which of the two gets to move first?
a : On the board, the dark. In #balance# they have the courtesy to remain a pair.
b : A game with one opening rule and an entirely different closing rule.

scene market
when topic=smalltalk self.likes=market_bustle
does tell.self / react.self / assess
a : A market in full voice gives me a rare chance to keep quite quiet.
b : Do you still follow the offers?
a : Only those that rise clear of #marketcall#. The rest remains other people's business.

scene frost
when topic=weather self.likes=frosty_mornings
does tell.plan / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I mean to draw #frostcoin# on the pane before the room heats up.
b : Why preserve a ring that cost you nothing?
a : To mark the morning's first touch of light.

scene fly
when topic=food self.dislikes=flies
does tell.complaint / react.complaint / assess
a : A fly on #chain# can move the lighter pan.
b : Could it move the price as well?
a : If I leave the fly in place. The balance gets checked before a figure goes down.

scene floor
when topic=work self.dislikes=wet_floors
does tell.worry / reassure / assess
a : I am uneasy at the sight of #stain# below a locked drawer.
b : Has the water found its way in?
a : I can check the blank leaves at the bottom. They take a mark before the accounts.

scene treasury
when topic=work self.workplace
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : At #self.workplace# I make a clean distinction between a royal payment and a private obligation.
b : And what stays in #scrap#?
a : What still needs a second view before I'm prepared to sign a public figure.

scene oddmoney
when topic=gossip
does give.opinion / disagree / concede
a : A private payment and a quiet gate may both deserve a second look.
b : Even a proper fee can be paid in private.
a : Exactly. That's why a note is a question and an accusation costs rather more.

scene spouse
when topic=family self.spouse
does offer / accept / assess
a : I save #counterone# for a game with #self.spouse# after the books close.
b : Must your household game have a tally too?
a : I'd rather end the evening knowing who won the board and nothing else.

scene child
when topic=family self.child
does tell.feeling / sympathise / assess
a : I like a quiet game across the squares from #self.child#.
b : Doesn't a treasurer want a good little reckoner?
a : A good reckoner in time, certainly. This game's a chance to play for a simple pleasure.

scene bowl
when topic=food
does offer / accept / assess
a : I can fill a small bowl with clear broth from this barley pot.
b : A little barley with the broth would suit me.
a : Then I'll stir gently. There's quite sufficient for a sound portion.

scene lean
when topic=prices world.times=hard|lean
does give.opinion / disagree / concede
a : A thin week is an argument for clearer sums.
b : The wolf carrying home less food might prefer a larger portion.
a : I'd have that portion weighed and paid for openly. Clarity can help it reach the table.

scene ground
when topic=land
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I can tell a heavily used stair by the hollow a coin settles into.
b : Do you actually put coin on a public step?
a : A dark counter serves me equally well. It has less interesting consequences if lost.

scene appointment
when topic=work
does tell.self / react.self / assess
a : A public appointment can rest on a word given in Council.
b : Does the word matter much once the post is filled?
a : It matters each time the holder is invited to overlook a doubtful sum.

scene travel
when topic=travel
does ask.advice / give.advice / assess
a : What would you pack round brass pans for a jolting road?
b : Fold cloth between the pans and take the chain off altogether.
a : I'll wrap #chain# round #weight#. That makes three loose objects into one bundle.

scene seaforge
when topic=lore
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Forge and sea give a purse an odd pair of measures.
b : What are their units?
a : A well-struck edge for one. For the other, the cost of a shipment that never arrives.

scene sleep
when topic=dreams
does tell.self / react.self / assess
a : I dreamed a board with a single dark square worth the whole treasury.
b : Did you take the square?
a : I turned the board over and found plain wood underneath. I slept much better afterward.

scene cart
when topic=travel world.wagons=late
does tell.worry / reassure / assess
a : A late revenue cart can hold up a column for days.
b : Can the waiting figure be entered provisionally?
a : I leave room beside its date. A blank in public is preferable to an invented certainty.

story counterfall [topic=pastimes]
  : My dark counter fell down between two boards during a long match.
  : I could see one edge whenever I leaned to the right.
  b : Which piece got you through the match?
  : With a barley grain. The grain won; the counter was recovered with its honour intact.

story soupink [topic=food]
  : A grain of barley once dried in the fold of an empty purse.
  : It gave my scale a small but insistent discrepancy.
  b : Was the purse short?
  : My dinner was. The account came right when I shook the purse over a saucer.

story frostbalance [topic=weather]
  : Frost hung from one pan like a very delicate fringe.
  : In the cold it weighed a surprising amount.
  b : Did you record that weight?
  : Only in memory. When I finally unfolded my paper the experiment had become a wet patch.

rule @brasspan
when concept=bark self.working=yes self.workplace
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Still both pans before the figure goes down.

rule @darkturn
when concept=bark self.likes=draughts
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Leave the dark piece on its own square.

rule @barleysettle
when concept=bark self.likes=barley_soup
does aside
cooldown 8h
say A quiet ladleful from below that shine.

rule @frostsill
when concept=bark self.likes=frosty_mornings
does aside
cooldown 8h
say A whole bright ring before the sun strikes it.

dlg @1 resident.hub [topic.meeting=stranger] : You may address me as #self.first#. A concise account will do.
dlg @2 resident.hub [topic.meeting=known] : #topic.player#, I have a little time before the next balance.
dlg @3 resident.hub [here.time=night] : There is still sufficient light to distinguish both sides of the board.
dlg @4 resident.hub [pair.disposition=wary|hostile] : Your current distance will do. I'll attend from here.
dlg @5 resident.job [self.workplace] : At #self.workplace# I handle the royal balances. A title gives a wolf the duty to answer for each one.
dlg @6 resident.job : I distinguish what has been paid from what has merely been promised.
dlg @7 resident.bye : A safe return with your accounts in order.

graft resident.hub
choice Are the dark counters currency? -> darkpurse
node darkpurse
say They are of known weight and uncertain value in a game. I keep public coin separate from either sort of wager.
choice Which wins on the scale? -> weighmen
choice I have a different question. -> hub
node weighmen
say Neither, with both men removed. A scale should begin at an empty balance; a game would be distinctly less agreeable that way.
choice Resume our audience. -> hub
choice I'll leave your pans steady. -> bye
